          "text": "{\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"/scenes/15/variants/0/text\",\"value_json\":\"Mallow performed a towering loop through the parade lane, waving from beneath the high banner. The cart’s shadow stretched across the stones like a crown.\"},{\"path\":\"/scenes/16/variants/0/text\",\"value_json\":\"Nia performed the book route at the neighborhood stop, bringing the loaded cart to the children who had been waiting.\"},{\"path\":\"/endings/0/text\",\"value_json\":\"The float completed its grand loop, banner flashing above Mallow’s hat. The wooden cart cast a giant shadow shaped like a crown across the parade lane.\"},{\"path\":\"/endings/2/text\",\"value_json\":\"At the neighborhood stop, Nia’s bookmobile stood ready for children, its loaded books snug inside while the brass bell hung quiet.\"},{\"path\":\"/endings/3/text\",\"value_json\":\"At the neighborhood stop, the loaded cart stood ready, its books still snug inside. The parade’s grand idea had become a smaller, rolling invitation.\"}]}",
